Read `AGENTS.md` first. Nested `apps/web/AGENTS.md` and `apps/studio/AGENTS.md` apply in those trees. Do not paste those files into the reply.

Hard constraints (full list in `AGENTS.md`):

- No `mailto:` in site UI. Email spec: `apps/web/CLAUDE.md`.
- No raw Tailwind palettes, no new hex outside `global.css`/emails, no new inline styles in `.astro`. Enforce with `pnpm --filter web lint:ui`.
- No emojis in the UI.
- Sanity fetches always `.catch` to a fallback. CMS outage must not 500.
- Talk ≠ event. Schema field changes also update `apps/web/src/lib/sanity/queries.ts`.
- New public pages: `.md` mirror + `llms.txt.ts` + OG map. Skill: `add-site-page`.
- Do not reimplement theme / reveal / `data-track` / cal.com modal (they live in `BaseLayout.astro`).
- Ignore `/src` at the repo root (legacy Next.js).

Prefer project MCPs in `.cursor/mcp.json` over guessing Sanity fields, PostHog events, or Vercel log state.
